--- a/docs/templates.rst
+++ b/docs/templates.rst
@@ -1693,6 +1693,20 @@ To bind more than one expression, separate each with a comma (``,``).
 To pluralize, specify both the singular and plural forms separated by
 the ``pluralize`` tag.
 
+A translation domain can be selected with a string literal in the block
+header. Domain blocks use ``dgettext`` or ``dngettext``. Without a
+domain, the ordinary translation callables are unchanged.
+
+.. code-block:: jinja
+
+    {% trans domain="admin" %}Settings{% endtrans %}
+
+    {% trans domain="shop", count=items|length %}
+        {{ count }} item
+    {% pluralize %}
+        {{ count }} items
+    {% endtrans %}
+
 .. code-block:: jinja
 
     {% trans count=list|length %}
